return {
    ["\n\n　　黛丝死了，死在反锁的占卜室内。她平静地躺在<Mark id=\"#159\">法阵</>中央，手腕有一道精准的<Mark id=\"#159\">割伤</>。官方结论是<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">自杀</>，但我知道，<Mark id=\"#159\">事情并非如此</>。 "] = "\n \n Daisy is dead, dead in the locked divination room. She lay peacefully in the center of the <Mark id=\"#159\"> magic circle, </> with a precise <Mark id=\"#159\"> cut </> on her wrist. The official conclusion is <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> suicide, </> but I know, <Mark id=\"#159\"> things are not so. </>",
    ["        那时我有两个选择，成为通识者途径的非凡者，或者窥秘人途径的非凡者，我的选择很简单——通识者，拥有完整序列的通识者！让自身变得强大，依靠自己的力量回到故乡，而不是寄希望于危险的外力。但当初的选择还是太草率了，不管是学徒，还是占卜家，或者偷盗者，都更好。可惜，没办法回头了……"] = "        Back then, I had two choices: become a Beyonder of the Savant pathway, or a Beyonder of the Mystery Pryer pathway. My choice was simple—Savant, a Savant with a complete sequence! To make myself strong and rely on my own power to return to my hometown, rather than pinning my hopes on dangerous external forces. But my choice back then was still too rash. Whether it was Apprentice, Seer, or Marauder, all would have been better. Unfortunately, there is no turning back...",
